  {
    "key": "component::sunweg::issues::integration_removed::description",
    "key_id": "627188987",
    "translation_id": "5503794110",
    "en": "The SunWEG integration has been removed from Home Assistant.\n\nThe library that Home Assistant uses to connect with SunWEG services, [doesn't work as expected anymore, demanding daily token renew]({issue}).\n\nTo resolve this issue, please remove the (now defunct) integration entries from your Home Assistant setup. [View your existing SunWEG integration entries]({entries}).",
    "sv": "SunWEG-integrationen har tagits bort från Home Assistant.\n\nBiblioteket som Home Assistant använder för att ansluta till SunWEG-tjänsterna [fungerar inte längre som förväntat och kräver att token förnyas dagligen]({issue}).\n\nTa bort de (nu obrukbara) SunWEG-integrationsposterna från din Home Assistant-konfiguration för att lösa problemet. [Visa dina befintliga SunWEG-integrationsposter]({entries}).",
    "verification_method": "Lokalise API live readback; pinned Core source and live reference targets checked",
    "source_revision": "86a2eabe7e43f526db5821ef068087ce8404ae07",
    "status": "saved-and-read-back",
    "verified_date": "2026-11-26"
  },
